              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Panuma yakwa Ehudi pakonkele Shamuga mwana Anati, uyo uwaipeye abena Filisiti imyanda mutanda (600). Abepeye ku musokofyo wakusokwelako iŋombe pakuti shileendesha. Nao wine alipuswisheko abena Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
